{"channelId":"UCA6eXM0M4iKa_4n-xFZ4xRA","row":["One On One Physical Therapy",66,"One On One Physical Therapy and Sports Rehabilitation strives to provide the absolute best in patient healthcare and service. We pride ourselves in delivering our best each day and in achieving optimal results. Each patient receives a thorough rehabilitation program customized to meet their individual needs and goals. No two people are the same, therefore their treatment program shouldn't be either. At One on One we ask you to expect more from physical therapy. Our professionals specialize in assessing human movement and body mechanics. We don't just treat the symptoms, we find the cause of the problem. We help you Reclaim your Life!","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCA6eXM0M4iKa_4n-xFZ4xRA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCA6eXM0M4iKa_4n-xFZ4xRA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:51.428Z","channelId":"UCA6eXM0M4iKa_4n-xFZ4xRA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"f1f29513c522508bd9ddb58c82c3b9e35b4de2aa9ced3663bede7ee93af3b71d","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"fab6003fe9a4fcfbc3c120fe317e452bd4138106e7e6dee0a650206c20e72357"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCA6eXM0M4iKa_4n-xFZ4xRA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":66,"raw":"66 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCA6eXM0M4iKa_4n-xFZ4xRA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:51.428Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCA6eXM0M4iKa_4n-xFZ4xRA"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"organization_self_report","excerpt":"One On One Physical T